.TH ALX-SETUP 1 "November 2026" "Algothix OS 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
alx-setup \- on-demand developer language profile installer for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B alx-setup
\fIprofile\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR]
.br
.B alx-setup list
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B alx-setup
installs curated developer language toolchains on demand from official Debian
repositories, printing expected disk and RAM costs prior to installation and
warning when installing heavier toolchains on \fBalx-profile-low\fR hardware.
.SH PROFILES
.TP
.B python
python3, python3-pip, python3-venv, python3-pytest
.TP
.B node
nodejs, npm
.TP
.B go
golang-go
.TP
.B rust
rustc, cargo, rustfmt
.TP
.B web
nodejs, npm, sqlite3, curl, jq
.TP
.B cpp
build-essential, clang, clangd, cmake, ninja-build, gdb, valgrind, pkg-config
.TP
.B java
default-jdk-headless, maven
.TP
.B editor-vscodium
Optional VSCodium installer notice with low-RAM warning.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Print expected disk/RAM costs and apt command without installing packages.
.TP
.B \-y, \-\-yes
Proceed without interactive confirmation.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Display version information.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display usage information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR alx-update (8),
.BR alx-doctor (1)
